.TH LIBMPQ__FILE_ADD_PATH 3 2026-08-18 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__file_add_path \- add a filesystem file to an MPQ archive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__file_add_path("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "archive,"
.BI "        const char     *" "name,"
.BI "        const char     *" "source_path,"
.BI "        const mpq_file_options_s *" "options"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads \fIsource_path\fP and adds it under the archive name \fIname\fP.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__archive_create (3),
.BR libmpq__file_add (3),
.BR libmpq__file_begin (3)
